      "key": "TUT_ADDON_THAUMICDYES",
      "pages": [
        {
          "id": "thaumicdyes:tut_addon_thaumicdyes/text/1",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumicdyes.tut_addon_thaumicdyes.text.1",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "神秘染料是什么\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumicdyes:tut_addon_thaumicdyes/text/2",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumicdyes.tut_addon_thaumicdyes.text.2",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "神秘染料是一个"
                },
                {
                  "text": "护甲与外观",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "扩展：可以制作并染色血腥教徒护甲，还提供可染色的要塞甲、神秘使长袍、旅行者护甲、虚空护甲，以及从基础到元始的一整套符文护甲。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumicdyes:tut_addon_thaumicdyes/divider/3",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumicdyes:tut_addon_thaumicdyes/text/4",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumicdyes.tut_addon_thaumicdyes.text.4",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "从哪里开始\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumicdyes:tut_addon_thaumicdyes/text/5",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumicdyes.tut_addon_thaumicdyes.text.5",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicdyes:TD.CRIMSON"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：血腥护甲锻造，失落研究，需要"
                },
                {
                  "research": "CRIMSON"
                },
                {
                  "text": "与魔力布匹，扫描血腥教徒护甲可以发现。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicdyes:TD.THAUMIUMROBE"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：神秘使长袍。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicdyes:TD.DYEDFORTRESS"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：强化要塞护甲。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicdyes:TD.RUNICARMOR"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：符文护甲。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicdyes:TD.PRIMALRUNICARMOR"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：深渊符文护甲。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
